msgid "Home Redirect"
msgstr "端口转发"

msgid "Home Redirect - Port forwarding utility"
msgstr "Home Redirect 端口转发"

msgid "HomeLede port forwarding application - fills the gaps left by firewall port forwarding, mainly used for cross-family forwarding under CGNAT."
msgstr "Homelede的端口转发应用，用于填补系统防火墙端口转发缺口，主要应用于CGNAT环境下跨协议栈转发。"

msgid "Typical scenarios: 1) CGNAT, only public IPv6 - forward a public v6 port to an internal IPv4 service (cross-family). 2) Moving target - use a domain name as destination, re-resolved on every connection. 3) TLS frontend - terminate TLS on the router, backend stays plain."
msgstr "典型场景：① CGNAT 仅有公网 IPv6——将公网 v6 端口转发至内网 IPv4 服务（跨族）；② 目标地址不固定——目标填域名，每次连接重新解析；③ TLS 前置——路由器终结 TLS，后端保持明文。"

