msgstr "TLS私钥"

msgid "Required by TLS rules. PEM certificate path, e.g. /etc/acme/your.domain/fullchain.cer. Configure together with the private key."
msgstr "TLS 规则必填。PEM 证书路径，如 /etc/acme/你的域名/fullchain.cer。须与私钥同时配置。"

msgid "PEM private key path matching the certificate above, e.g. /etc/acme/your.domain/your.domain.key. With a combined cert+key file, set both fields to the same path."
msgstr "与上方证书配对的 PEM 私钥路径，如 /etc/acme/你的域名/你的域名.key。若为证书私钥合一文件，两栏填同一路径即可。"

